"/apartment-in-hosahalli">Apartments in Hosahalli</a></li><li><a href="/apartments-in-hsr-layout">Apartments in HSR Layout</a></li><li><a href="/apartments-in-guindy">Apartments in Guindy</a></li><li><a href="/apartments-in-medavakkam">Apartments in Medavakkam</a></li><li><a href="/apartments-in-chembur">Apartments in Chembur</a></li><li><a href="/apartments-in-bavdhan">Apartments in Bavdhan</a></li><li><a href="/apartments-in-keshav-nagar">Apartments in Keshav Nagar</a></li><li><a href="/apartments-on-marine-drive-kochi">Apartments in Marine Drive Kochi</a></li></ul></div><div class="col-12"><h4 class="widget-title text-capitalize mb-2 blue_text __className_fdde39">Luxury Projects (Villas)</h4><ul class="__className_fdde39 links2 list-unstyled links"><li><a href="/villas-in-bannerghatta-road">Villas in Bannerghatta Road</a></li></ul></div><div class="col-12"><h4 class="widget-title text-capitalize mb-2 blue_text __className_fdde39">Trending Projects</h4><ul class="__className_fdde39 links2 list-unstyled links"><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/purva-heritage">Purva Heritage</a></li><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/purva-silversky">Purva Silversky</a></li><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/northern-lights-by-puravankara-kvn-north-bengaluru">Northern Lights by Puravankara | KVN</a></li><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/purva-atmosphere">Purva Atmosphere</a></li><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/purva-park-hill">Purva Parkhill</a></li><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/purva-blubelle">Purva Blubelle</a></li><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/purva-zenium">Purva Zenium</a></li><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/purva-celestial">Purva Celestial</a></li><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/purva-meraki">Purva Meraki</a></li><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/purva-sparkling-springs">Purva Sparkling Springs</a></li><li><a href="/residential/chennai/purva-windermere">Purva Windermere</a></li><li><a href="/residential/kochi/purva-marina-one">Marina One</a></li><li><a href="/residential/pune/purva-silversand">Purva Silversands</a></li><li><a href="/residential/pune/purva-emerald-bay">Purva Emerald Bay</a></li><li><a href="/residential/chennai/purva-somerset-house">Purva Somerset House</a></li><li><a href="/residential/mumbai/purva-clermont">Purva Clermont</a></li><li><a href="/residential/bengaluru/purva-orient-grand">Purva Orient Grand</a></li><li><a href="/residential/pune/purva-aspire">Purva Aspire</a></li></ul></div><div class="col-12"><h4 class="widget-title text-capitalize mb-2 blue_text __className_fdde39">Popular Blogs</h4><ul class="__className_fdde39 links2 list-unstyled links"></ul></div><div class="col-12"><h4 class="widget-title text-capitalize mb-2 blue_text __className_fdde39">QUICK LINKS</h4><ul class="__className_fdde39 links2 list-unstyled links"><li><a href="/nri-corner/#emicalculator">Home Loan EMI Calculator</a></li><li><a href="/nri-corner">NRI Corner</a></li></ul></div><div class="footer-seo-content mt-4 d-none"><div class="seo-content-short"><h2>Puravankara: Among the Top Real Estate Developers in India</h2><p>Puravankara has established itself as one of the top real estate developers in India, delivering premium residential developments that combine quality construction, thoughtful design, and long-term value.</p></div><div class="seo-content-more"><h2>A Trusted Real Estate Developer in India</h2><p>Choosing the right developer is one of the most important decisions when purchasing a home. As a leading real estate developer in India, Puravankara follows stringent quality standards, transparent business practices, and customer-centric processes throughout every stage of project development.</p><h2>Puravankara - One of the Top Builders in Bangalore</h2><p>Bengaluru continues to be one of India&#x27;s fastest-growing real estate markets, driven by its thriving IT industry, expanding infrastructure, and growing demand for premium housing.</p><h2>Why Puravankara is Among the Top Real Estate Builders in Bangalore</h2><p>As one of the top real estate builders in Bangalore, Puravankara focuses on creating homes that combine functionality, aesthetics, and long-term value.</p><ul><li>Premium residential developments across prime Bengaluru locations</li><li>Contemporary architecture with efficient floor plans</li><li>High-quality construction and premium specifications</li><li>Lifestyle amenities including clubhouses, swimming pools, fitness centres, landscaped gardens, and children&#x27;s play areas</li><li>Excellent connectivity to IT corridors, metro stations, and major road networks</li><li>Strong emphasis on sustainability and community living</li></ul><h2>Leading Real Estate Builders in Bangalore with a Legacy of Excellence</h2><p>Among the leading real estate builders in Bangalore, Puravankara has consistently delivered projects that cater to evolving homebuyer preferences. Whether buyers are looking for luxury apartments, spacious family homes, or investment opportunities, the company offers developments across multiple price segments while maintaining high standards of quality and design.</p><h2>Top Builders in India Delivering Premium Communities</h2><p>Being recognised among the top builders in India requires more than constructing residential buildings. It involves creating vibrant communities where residents enjoy convenience, safety, and a better quality of life.</p><p>Puravankara integrates modern infrastructure, green open spaces, smart planning, and lifestyle amenities into every project.</p><h2>Why Homebuyers Choose Puravankara</h2><ul><li>Decades of experience in residential development</li><li>Premium apartments in prime locations</li><li>RERA-compliant projects</li><li>Modern amenities and lifestyle facilities</li><li>Sustainable design principles</li><li>Trusted brand reputation</li><li>Excellent appreciation potential</li><li>Strong focus on customer experience</li></ul><h2>A Preferred Choice Among Top Developers in Bangalore</h2><p>For homebuyers comparing the top developers in Bangalore, Puravankara stands out through its consistent delivery of premium residential communities, strategic project locations, and superior construction quality.</p><h2>Building Homes Across India</h2><p>As one of the leading real estate builders in India, Puravankara continues to expand its presence by developing residential projects that meet the changing needs of modern homebuyers.</p><p>Recognised among the top real estate developers in Bangalore and the top real estate developers in India, Puravankara remains dedicated to creating homes that combine thoughtful design, modern amenities, strategic locations, and lasting value for generations to come.</p><div class="seo-faq-section"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><h3>Which is the best real estate company in Bangalore?</h3><p>Puravankara is widely recognized as one of the best real estate companies in Bangalore, with a legacy dating back to 1975. The company has developed premium residential communities known for quality construction, innovative design, and customer-centric planning. With projects across prime locations in Bengaluru and other major Indian cities, Puravankara focuses on sustainable development, timely delivery, and modern amenities.</p><h3>Who are the top builders in Bangalore for premium residential projects?</h3><p>Among the top builders in Bangalore, Puravankara has earned a strong reputation for delivering thoughtfully designed residential developments. With nearly five decades of experience, the company offers luxury apartments, premium residences, and integrated communities across key locations in Bengaluru.</p><h3>Why should I invest in real estate in Bangalore?</h3><p>Real estate in Bangalore continues to attract homebuyers and investors because of the city&#x27;s growing IT sector, infrastructure development, employment opportunities, and strong housing demand. Bengaluru offers excellent appreciation potential across established and emerging locations.</p><h3>What makes Puravankara one of the best builders in Bangalore?</h3><p>Puravankara stands out among the best builders in Bangalore because of its commitment to quality, innovation, customer satisfaction, and transparent business practices. Established in 1975, the company has successfully delivered landmark residential and commercial developments across India.</p><h3>Which are the top real estate companies in India?</h3><p>India is home to several reputed real estate developers, and Puravankara is recognized among the top real estate companies in India. Headquartered in Bengaluru, the company has expanded across multiple cities while maintaining high standards of construction, design, and customer experience.</p><h3>Why choose experienced real estate developers in India?</h3><p>Experienced real estate developers in India offer greater confidence through proven project execution, quality construction, legal transparency, and reliable customer support. Puravankara brings nearly five decades of industry expertise, delivering homes that meet high standards of engineering and design.</p><h3>Which are the best residential projects in Bangalore?</h3><p>The best residential projects in Bangalore are those that combine excellent location, quality construction, lifestyle amenities, and long-term appreciation potential. Puravankara offers a diverse portfolio of luxury apartments, premium residences, and integrated communities across Bengaluru.</p><h3>What types of homes does Puravankara offer?</h3><p>Puravankara offers a wide range of residential options including luxury apartments, premium residences, villas, and plotted developments across major Indian cities. Homebuyers can choose from thoughtfully designed configurations that suit families, professionals, first-time buyers, and investors.</p><h3>How does Puravankara support sustainable living?</h3><p>Puravankara integrates sustainability into its developments through energy-efficient planning, water conservation systems, rainwater harvesting, waste management practices, landscaped green spaces, and environmentally responsible construction methods.</p><h3>Why should I choose Puravankara for my next home?</h3><p>Choosing Puravankara means investing with one of India&#x27;s most trusted real estate developers. With nearly five decades of expertise, the company has consistently delivered premium residential communities that combine innovative architecture, quality construction, sustainable design, and customer-focused experiences.</p><h3>What amenities can I expect in Puravankara residential projects?</h3><p>Puravankara residential projects are designed to provide a comfortable and modern lifestyle with amenities such as clubhouses, swimming pools, fitness centres, landscaped gardens, children&#x27;s play areas, jogging tracks, indoor games, sports courts, multipurpose halls, and round-the-clock security.</p><h3>What makes Puravankara projects a good investment?</h3><p>Puravankara projects are located in high-growth residential destinations with strong infrastructure and connectivity, making them attractive for both end-users and investors. The company&#x27;s reputation for quality construction and premium developments adds long-term value to every property.</p><h3>How does Puravankara maintain construction quality?</h3><p>Puravankara follows rigorous quality standards throughout every stage of project development, from planning and engineering to construction and final delivery. The company uses modern construction practices, premium materials, and experienced professionals to ensure durability, safety, and design excellence.</p><h3>How can I book a home with Puravankara?</h3><p>Booking a home with Puravankara is simple. You can explore residential projects on the official website, compare locations, floor plans, amenities, and pricing, and submit an enquiry for expert assistance. The sales team helps you understand project details, site visits, payment plans, and the booking process.</p></div></div><button type="button" class="seo-read-more-btn">Explore More</button></div></div></div></div></div></div></footer><button id="progress" aria-label="scroll to top button"><svg class="circle" width="100" height="100" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="30" class="bg"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="30" class="indicator" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0px" stroke-dasharray="1px 1px"></circle></svg><svg class="arrow" width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 30 30" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.8358 25.2358C15.6671 25.4044 15.4383 25.499 15.1998 25.499C14.9613 25.499 14.7326 25.4044 14.5638 25.2358L7.36382 18.0358C7.27539 17.9534 7.20447 17.8541 7.15528 17.7437C7.10609 17.6333 7.07964 17.5141 7.07751 17.3932C7.07538 17.2724 7.0976 17.1524 7.14287 17.0403C7.18813 16.9282 7.25551 16.8264 7.34097 16.741C7.42643 16.6555 7.52823 16.5881 7.6403 16.5429C7.75237 16.4976 7.8724 16.4754 7.99324 16.4775C8.11409 16.4796 8.23326 16.5061 8.34366 16.5553C8.45406 16.6045 8.55342 16.6754 8.63582 16.7638L14.2998 22.4278L14.2998 5.39981C14.2998 5.16112 14.3946 4.9322 14.5634 4.76342C14.7322 4.59463 14.9611 4.49981 15.1998 4.49981C15.4385 4.49981 15.6674 4.59463 15.8362 4.76342C16.005 4.9322 16.0998 5.16112 16.0998 5.39981L16.0998 22.4278L21.7638 16.7638C21.8462 16.6754 21.9456 16.6045 22.056 16.5553C22.1664 16.5061 22.2855 16.4796 22.4064 16.4775C22.5272 16.4754 22.6473 16.4976 22.7593 16.5429C22.8714 16.5881 22.9732 16.6555 23.0587 16.741C23.1441 16.8264 23.2115 16.9282 23.2568 17.0403C23.302 17.1524 23.3243 17.2724 23.3221 17.3932C23.32 17.5141 23.2935 17.6333 23.2444 17.7437C23.1952 17.8541 23.1242 17.9534 23.0358 18.0358L15.8358 25.2358Z" fill="white"></path></svg></button><div class="stickywrapper d-none d-md-flex"><button class="stickyenq __className_fdde39">Enquire Now</button></div><div class="popupform"></div><div class="stick-enquire2 d-flex d-lg-none w-100"><div class="d-flex  w-100 align-items-center justify-content-evenly"><a href="tel:08044555555" class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center"><img alt="call us" loading="lazy" width="25" height="25" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;fill:#000" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ficons%2Fs1.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ficons%2Fs1.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Ficons%2Fs1.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><span class="text-white floater-text mt-1">CALL-US</span></a><div class="d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center"><img alt="ENQUIRE NOW" loading="lazy" width="25" height="25" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;fill:#000" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fformm.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fformm.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fformm.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><span class="floater-text text-white mt-1">ENQUIRE NOW</span></div></div></div></div><script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script id="__NEXT_DATA__" type="application/json">{"props":{"pageProps":{"leadership":{"id":1,"attributes":{"createdAt":"2025-07-17T12:36:40.647Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-25T04:44:12.444Z","publishedAt":"2025-07-17T12:36:41.867Z","seo":{"id":308,"metaTitle":"Puravankara Leadership Team \u0026 Company Vision","metaDescription":"Meet the leadership team of Puravankara Group. Discover the visionaries driving growth, innovation, and excellence in real estate development.","keywords":"residential properties in bangalore, upcoming projects in bangalore, new residential projects in bangalore, upcoming projects in north bangalore","metaRobots":null,"metaViewport":null,"canonicalURL":null,"schema":[],"metaSocial":[],"metaImage":{"data":null}},"Banner":null,"teamsection":{"id":2,"sectiontitle":"Our Leadership","subtitle":"Meet our Leaders","shortdesc":"A great team of executives with faith in their beliefs and have smart perspectives on the qualities necessary for effective leadership to lead the organization to greatness.","teams":{"data":[{"id":2,"attributes":{"Name":"Mr. Ravi Puravankara","Description":"\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eRavi Puravankara, a visionary and dynamic leader, is the Founder \u0026amp; Chairman of Puravankara Limited – one of India’s most admired and trusted real estate brands. Under his guidance and decisive leadership, the company has built an impressive portfolio of completed residential and commercial properties across nine cities.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eA developer extraordinaire, Ravi prioritises all business decisions, keeping the company’s long-term trust and credibility among stakeholders in mind. He established a strong framework of good corporate governance and decided not to deal with unaccounted money from the very beginning. This was unheard of in the early 70s and is one of the most distinguishing features of the company’s culture even today. It helped lay a strong foundation for the brand Puravankara based on transparency and ethical practices.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eThis also helped Puravankara Limited secure one of the first foreign direct investments (FDI) in the Indian real estate market in 2005. The group then established a joint venture (JV) with Keppel Land, a development company owned by the Singapore Government.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eUnder Ravi Puravankara's strategic leadership, Puravankara Limited made history by becoming one of the early real estate players to list on the Indian stock exchanges in 2007. In 2008, Provident Housing Limited, a wholly owned subsidiary, was established under his aegis to address the aspirations of upwardly mobile Indians and first-home buyers. Further, in December 2020, the Company successfully mobilised US$ 76 million from the International Finance Corporation (IFC) and IFC Emerging Asia Fund (EAF) for investment in Provident Housing. Subsequently, he led the launch of Purva Land to cater to the needs of people desirous of plotted developments.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eRecognising the need for backward integration in construction, he established Starworth Infrastructure and Construction Limited (SICL) as an internal engineering division of the group. Additionally, Purva Streaks, the interior design arm, caters to customers looking for an integrated interior design solution.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eHis constant emphasis on customer needs and delight has earned him several awards and accolades, including the Lifetime Achievement Award 2023 by CREDAI Karnataka and the Lifetime Achievement Award by Construction Week Magazine. Under his stewardship, in 2020, Puravankara Limited was bestowed with an Honourable Mention for Excellence in Digital Disruption at the World Economic Forum New Champion Awards.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eBeyond business, Ravi Puravankara is dedicated to driving positive social and environmental outcomes. Under his guidance, the company’s CSR initiatives are helping transform people’s lives positively in educating underprivileged children, water conservation; afforestation, and several long-term initiatives championing a sustainable and equitable future. For these efforts, the company bagged the prestigious Vishwakarma Award for Social Development and Impact in 2024, instituted by the Construction Industry Development Council (CIDC).\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","createdAt":"2025-03-19T05:06:09.802Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-28T06:09:24.823Z","publishedAt":"2025-03-19T05:13:12.171Z","position":"Founder and Chairman","subpos":"Chairman of the Board and Management Sub-Committee.","slug":"mr-ravi-puravankara","leadership_description":"\u003cp\u003eMr. Ravi Puravankara, is the Founder and Chairman of Puravankara Limited, one of the most admired and trusted real estate brands in India. Over the years, under his strategic guidance and effective leadership, the company has successfully developed an array of residential and commercial projects spread across nine Indian cities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMr. Ravi is a trailblazer in the industry, and his approach has always been centered on long-term trust and credibility in every business decision.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMr. Ravi’s vision has helped Puravankara Limited secure one of the earliest FDI deals in the Indian real estate sector in 2005.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe has successfully led the company through yet another milestone by being one of the earliest entrants in the Indian real estate sector to get listed on stock exchanges in India in 2007.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRavi Puravankara is committed to the cause of social and environmental responsibility. Through his leadership, the company’s CSR initiatives have created significant impact in the areas of education for underprivileged children, water conservation, afforestation, and sustainability.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","full_time_positions":"\u003ch3 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#215E99;\"\u003eDirectorships and full-time positions in Body Corporates\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"table\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\";\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color:#0F9ED5;border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:#0F9ED5;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:none;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:41.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:52.35pt;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:white;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSR.\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;NO.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color:#0F9ED5;border-bottom:1.0pt solid #0F9ED5;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-top:1.0pt solid #0F9ED5;height:41.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:252.2pt;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:white;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNAMES OF THE BODY CORPORATE\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color:#0F9ED5;border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:#0F9ED5;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:41.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:159.7pt;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:white;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDESIGNATION\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color:#CAEDFB;border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:#60CAF3;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;border-width:1.0pt;height:53.0pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:464.25pt;\" colspan=\"3\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:black;\"\u003eNIL\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/figure\u003e","Image":{"data":{"id":2761,"attributes":{"name":"11 (2).png","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":517,"height":487,"formats":{"small":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/small_11_2_320bf8a3aa.png","hash":"small_11_2_320bf8a3aa","mime":"image/png","name":"small_11 (2).png","path":null,"size":336.91,"width":500,"height":471,"sizeInBytes":336912},"thumbnail":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_11_2_320bf8a3aa.png","hash":"thumbnail_11_2_320bf8a3aa","mime":"image/png","name":"thumbnail_11 (2).png","path":null,"size":51.33,"width":166,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":51331}},"hash":"11_2_320bf8a3aa","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","size":97.18,"url":"/uploads/11_2_320bf8a3aa.png","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-06-18T05:53:02.372Z","updatedAt":"2025-06-18T05:53:02.372Z"}}}}},{"id":7,"attributes":{"Name":"Mr. Nani Rusi Choksey","Description":"\u003cp\u003eMr. Nani R. Choksey brings around five decades of unparalleled experience in real estate development, construction, and finance, underpinned by his sharp business acumen. A founding pillar of Puravankara since its inception in 1975, Mr. Choksey played a crucial role in its growth and success. In the company’s formative years, he single-handedly managed various departments, including legal affairs and customer relations. Mr. Choksey continues to be deeply involved in all of the company’s projects, leveraging his vast industry knowledge, meticulous attention to detail, and unwavering commitment to growth. His enduring dedication and expertise remain integral to Puravankara’s ongoing success and expansion.\u003c/p\u003e","createdAt":"2025-07-17T12:12:12.704Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-04T09:49:27.969Z","publishedAt":"2025-07-18T05:54:54.640Z","position":"Vice Chairman","subpos":null,"slug":"nani-rusi-choksey","leadership_description":"","full_time_positions":null,"Image":{"data":{"id":2855,"attributes":{"name":"Nani.png","alternativeText":null,"caption":null,"width":1034,"height":974,"formats":{"large":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/large_Nani_305ffe1068.png","hash":"large_Nani_305ffe1068","mime":"image/png","name":"large_Nani.png","path":null,"size":1513.05,"width":1000,"height":942,"sizeInBytes":1513050},"small":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/small_Nani_305ffe1068.png","hash":"small_Nani_305ffe1068","mime":"image/png","name":"small_Nani.png","path":null,"size":435.61,"width":500,"height":471,"sizeInBytes":435605},"medium":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/medium_Nani_305ffe1068.png","hash":"medium_Nani_305ffe1068","mime":"image/png","name":"medium_Nani.png","path":null,"size":918.83,"width":750,"height":706,"sizeInBytes":918829},"thumbnail":{"ext":".png","url":"/uploads/thumbnail_Nani_305ffe1068.png","hash":"thumbnail_Nani_305ffe1068","mime":"image/png","name":"thumbnail_Nani.png","path":null,"size":55.54,"width":166,"height":156,"sizeInBytes":55541}},"hash":"Nani_305ffe1068","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","size":454.78,"url":"/uploads/Nani_305ffe1068.png","previewUrl":null,"provider":"local","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2025-07-18T05:54:51.415Z","updatedAt":"2025-07-18T05:54:51.415Z"}}}}},{"id":1,"attributes":{"Name":"Mr. Ashish R Puravankara","Description":"\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eMr. Ashish R. Puravankara is the Managing Director and Director on the board of Puravankara Limited. He oversees the entire business, primarily identifying growth opportunities for Puravankara Limited. He has played a vital role in ensuring superior construction quality by leveraging innovative technologies. Ashish's strong entrepreneurial vision led to the launch of Provident Housing, a leading large-scale community developer. This venture also led to the subsequent launch of Purva Land, a plotted development arm.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eUnder Ashish's decisive leadership, Puravankara has completed several residential and commercial projects across nine cities (Bengaluru, Mumbai, Pune, Goa, Hyderabad, Chennai, Kochi, Coimbatore, and Mangaluru) in India. The company has also successfully entered the Mumbai redevelopment market and is looking to expand its presence in the West. Puravankara Limited's steady growth is a testament to his strategic formulation, financial acumen, and enterprise development expertise. His global exposure and access to a diverse network have continually enabled him to innovate and redefine success for the company.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eToday, Ashish is widely recognised in the industry for his deep understanding and knowledge of the real estate sector and his drive for excellence. He has held the position of President of CREDAI Bengaluru in the past. He has been recognised with several awards, some of which are – the Grohe Hurun India Residential Real Estate Developer Award 2023, the Real Estate Person of the Year-South by Construction Week India (2023), the Real Estate Thought Leader of the Year - IBE 6th India Property Awards (2021) and Best MD of the Year - CIA World Awards (2020).\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"\u003eAshish holds a Bachelor of Science (BSc.) Degree in Business from Virginia Polytechnic Institute and State University and a Master of Business Administration (MBA) from Willamette University in Salem, Oregon. He is passionate about travel, adventure and motorsports.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","createdAt":"2025-03-19T05:06:06.811Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-28T06:26:10.710Z","publishedAt":"2025-03-19T05:17:12.662Z","position":"Managing Director","subpos":"Board Member, Member of Audit Committee, Stakeholder Relationship Committee, Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) Committee, Management Sub-Committee and Chairperson of Risk Management Committee.","slug":"mr-ashish-ravi-puravankara","leadership_description":"\u003cp\u003eMr. Ashish R. Puravankara is the Managing Director and a member of the Board of Directors at Puravankara Limited. His role in the company involves managing the overall business operations with a special focus on exploring business growth. Ashish has been successful in improving the quality of construction by incorporating new technologies.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith the dynamic leadership of Mr. Ashish R. Puravankara, the company has successfully delivered several projects in the residential and commercial segments across nine cities in India. The company is currently working towards strengthening its presence in western India. The success of Puravankara Limited is a clear indication of the strategic acumen, financial knowledge, and capabilities of Mr. Ashish R. Puravankara in the field of enterprise development.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAshish is highly regarded within the industry for his knowledge and commitment to excellence. He has also served as the President of CREDAI Bengaluru. Over the years, Ashish has received many accolades for his work. These include the Grohe Hurun India Residential Real Estate Developer Award (2023), Real Estate Person of the Year – South at Construction Week India (2023), to name a few.\u003c/p\u003e","full_time_positions":"\u003ch3 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:#215E99;\"\u003eDirectorships and full-time positions in Body Corporates\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cfigure class=\"table\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\";\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color:#0F9ED5;border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:#0F9ED5;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:none;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:41.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:52.35pt;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:white;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSR.\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;NO.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color:#0F9ED5;border-bottom:1.0pt solid #0F9ED5;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-top:1.0pt solid #0F9ED5;height:41.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:232.35pt;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:white;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNAMES OF THE BODY CORPORATE\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color:#0F9ED5;border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:#0F9ED5;border-left-style:none;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:solid;border-width:1.0pt;height:41.25pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:179.55pt;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color:white;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDESIGNATION\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:#60CAF3;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;border-width:1.0pt;height:45.85pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:52.35pt;\"\u003e1.\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-top-style:none;height:45.85pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:232.35pt;\"\u003eVarishtha Property Developers Private Limited\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-left-style:none;border-right:1.0pt solid #60CAF3;border-top-style:none;height:45.85pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt;vertical-align:top;width:179.55pt;\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eDirector\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-bottom-style:solid;border-color:#60CAF3;border-left-style:solid;border-right-style:solid;border-top-style:none;border